OL,3,GNEWSASir Chris 'not playing hardball'  
OL,4,Aover Stormont budget                   
OL,6,FThe secretary of state has denied he is
OL,7,F"playing hardball" with the Stormont   
OL,8,Fexecutive despite a stalemate over     
OL,9,Fagreeing a budget for this financial   
OL,10,Fyear.                                  
OL,12,FSir Chris Bryant said he was working   
OL,13,Fall hours to try and get a resolution  
OL,14,Fbefore Christmas.                      
OL,16,FNo budget has been agreed by Northern  
OL,17,FIreland's four-party coalition almost  
OL,18,Feight months into the financial year,  
OL,19,Fbut ministers maintain it is impossible
OL,20,Fwithout extra financial help from      
OL,21,FLondon.                                
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
